<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 394 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 394 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 394 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.</p>
<p>It bought 204 million stg outright and 190 million stg in repos to 24 and 25 March.</p>
<p>The money market shortage was revised to 1.3 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 71 42 7715</p>
